BT 1 0 0 1 48 595.8898 Tm (minimizes a forward-KL barycenter objective, whereas the normalized weighted geometric pool minimizes the reverse-KL barycenter) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 48 584.6898 Tm (objective.) Tj T* ET
